{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"359550","name":"彩虹六号：围攻","title":"彩虹六号：围攻","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《彩虹六号：围攻》是战术团队射击游戏中无可争议的典范，明智的策略和行动力是制胜关键。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >免费体验快速对战和非排名战游戏模式，同时解锁精选特勤干员。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >排名战对战列表、围攻杯、额外特勤干员和装饰物品等特定内容和功能需要付费解锁。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >高风险5v5对战 进攻方VS防守方</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >攻防交替互换，针对特勤干员和地图调整战术。感受行动的紧张与刺激，充分运用强大的破坏工具和各式设备，用智慧和技巧压制对手，赢得每一局对战。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/b46a642146a277ffa1700bb1008cd598.poster.avif?t=1792001976\" width=780 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/b46a642146a277ffa1700bb1008cd598.webm?t=1792001976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/b46a642146a277ffa1700bb1008cd598.mp4?t=1792001976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >如果你加入防守方，就将四周环境变成坚不可摧的堡垒。加固墙壁，设置路障，布置陷阱，控制敌人的动向。利用监控工具收集情报，预判敌人的进攻路线。坚守阵地，针对敌方的战术灵活应变，以技巧取胜。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/d871f7238f08043965c734a172638018.poster.avif?t=1792001976\" width=780 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/d871f7238f08043965c734a172638018.webm?t=1792001976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/d871f7238f08043965c734a172638018.mp4?t=1792001976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >如果你加入进攻方，则要操控观测无人机侦察敌方位置和炸弹点情报。与团队通力合作，突破重重防线，巧妙避开陷阱，出其不意地开辟突破口。通过垂直突袭，从上方或下方攻其不备，或是绳降突入窗户，发起英勇进攻。制定周密的进攻计划，果断执行，化解一切危机。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >破坏工具</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/a1d5a6afc4aefda6d913424d9a0a7645.poster.avif?t=1792001976\" width=780 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/a1d5a6afc4aefda6d913424d9a0a7645.webm?t=1792001976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/a1d5a6afc4aefda6d913424d9a0a7645.mp4?t=1792001976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >破坏不仅是制造混乱，更是通往胜利的关键武器。巧妙利用周围环境，将厚重的墙壁变成通向机遇的窗口。运用最尖端的技术追踪敌方动向，打破墙壁开拓视野，操控环境，牢牢掌握战术优势。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >从新兵到精英</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这趟充实的入门之旅专为新玩家量身打造，设有全新的等级路径，帮助你循序渐进地掌握基础操作、提升技巧、建立自信，让你以最佳状态投入紧张刺激的实战。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >持续扩展</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每个赛季都带来重大更新，新增内容和功能，为战术和玩法注入新活力。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >高度竞技性</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >加入超过8,000万玩家的庞大在线社区。观看顶级职业战队在久负盛名的《彩虹六号：围攻》电竞赛事中展开巅峰对决。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >免费进入游戏，部分内容和功能（包括竞技游戏模式、特勤干员和装饰物品）需要付费解锁。</p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/1c7b1ea3405a69c54429e2aa3dc31f3cbbeaa456/header_alt_assets_28.jpg?t=1792001976","website":"http://rainbow6.ubi.com/","developers":["Ubisoft Montreal"],"publishers":["Ubisoft"],"release_date":"2015 年 12 月 1 日","coming_soon":false,"supported_languages":"英语<strong>*</strong>, 法语<strong>*</strong>, 意大利语<strong>*</strong>, 德语<strong>*</strong>, 西班牙语 - 西班牙<strong>*</strong>, 捷克语, 荷兰语, 日语<strong>*</strong>, 韩语, 波兰语, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西<strong>*</strong>, 俄语<strong>*</strong>, 繁体中文, 简体中文, 土耳其语, 泰语<br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","多人","玩家对战","线上玩家对战","合作","在线合作","完全支持控制器","Steam 集换式卡牌","应用内购买","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","在手机上远程畅玩","在平板上远程畅玩"],"genres":["动作","免费开玩"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11 (64-bit versions)<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 3100 / Intel i3-8100<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1650 4GB / AMD RX 5500XT 4GB / Intel ARC A380 6GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>网络:</strong> 宽带互联网连接<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 65 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>声卡:</strong> DirectX® 9.0c compatible sound card with latest drivers<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> For an up-to-date list of supported chipsets, please visit the FAQ for this game on our support website. Game contains BattleEye anti-cheat technology.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit versions)<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> AMD Ryzen5 3600 / Intel i5-10400<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 6GB / AMD RX 6600 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>网络:</strong> 宽带互联网连接<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 65 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>声卡:</strong> DirectX® 9.0c compatible sound card 5.1 with latest drivers<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> For an up-to-date list of supported chipsets, please visit the FAQ for this game on our support website. Game contains BattleEye anti-cheat technology.</li></ul>"},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/2efed3587d876f560cbf3f25d9a72fbd387b74e6/ss_2efed3587d876f560cbf3f25d9